1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Meet Opportunities, your private editorial companion inside Ghost.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Connect using your server address, Ghost site, and editor token. Airtable and Ghost credentials stay on the server.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Review the latest eight opportunities. Search, filter, check sources, approve, reject, or reopen an item for another review.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Edit titles, descriptions, deadlines, categories, and links, then save your changes back to Airtable.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Add approved opportunities to a draft, preserving existing content. Approvals can also sync automatically to a configured
Ghost page.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Need a replacement? Swap in another approved opportunity. Only that card changes; your other editorial content stays
intact.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Type reject Globex, review the proposed action, and confirm. These are simple commands, not full AI chat.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
The activity feed tracks changes. Refresh for updates, collapse the panel, or disconnect your session.

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Extension, server, Airtable and Ghost. This demo uses sample data. Live connections need your credentials.
